Title: SafeRAG: A Large-Language-Model-Based Multistage Retrieval-Augmented Framework for Oil and Gas Safety Report Generation. Authors: Qianwen Cao, Chiyu Zhang, Junxiong Ning, Gongru Li. Categories: unknown. Abstract: Summary In high-risk industrial settings, leveraging large language models (LLMs) for automated accident analysis and generating safety reports has emerged as an efficient workflow